  // ---- Key twins (2026-09-17) -----------------------------------------------------
  // What the chevron code decides, for every built row, with keys mapped through
  // __ksCanon: row visibility and classes, summary / group keys, each label cell's
  // rowspan, display, alignment and classes, and every chevron in it (key, level,
  // classes, arrow). Label text and pixel offsets are left out: they differ
